{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15129","headline":"五城道中 · 李益","name":"五城道中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金铙随玉节，落日河边路。\n沙鸣後骑来，雁起前军度。\n五城鸣斥堠，三秦新召募。\n天寒白登道，塞浊阴山雾。\n仍闻旧兵老，尚在乌兰戍。\n笳箫汉思繁，旌旗边色故。\n寝兴倦弓甲，勤役伤风露。\n来远赏不行，锋交勳乃茂。\n未知朔方道，何年罢兵赋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15129.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15129","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}